          "id": "restorative-hospitality-editorial",
          "name": "Restorative hospitality editorial",
          "promptGuidance": "Quiet editorial hospitality photography in a real-feeling boutique hotel with adult guests and staff shown through natural gestures, hands and partial figures, tactile linens, glass and pale wood under soft window light, using crisp white #FFFFFF, sea-glass #DCEDEA and deep teal #123B3A with generous negative space, no text or lettering.",
          "subjects": "Guest arrival rituals, prepared rooms, quiet lounges and terraces, staff handoffs, towels, water, tea, journals, and simple wellness materials; avoid posed yoga, medical treatment, logos, and generic resort-spa clichés.",
